---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Photo from '../../components/Photo.astro';
import Cta from '../../components/Cta.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
import { areas, groups } from '../../data/areas';
import { services } from '../../data/services';
export const getStaticPaths = () => areas.map(area=>({ params:{slug:area.slug},props:{area} }));
const { area: a } = Astro.props;
const g = groups[a.group];
const isNorthBalgowlah = a.slug === 'north-balgowlah';
const relevant = services.filter(s => (g.services as readonly string[]).includes(s.slug));
const nearby = areas.filter(x=>x.group===a.group && x.slug!==a.slug);
---
<Layout title={`Blocked Drains ${a.name} | CCTV & Drain Clearing`} description={`Blocked drains in ${a.name}: learn about CCTV diagnosis, jetting and repair options, then call ${site.phone} to discuss access and booking.`} crumbs={[{name:'Service areas',href:'/service-areas'},{name:a.name,href:`/service-areas/${a.slug}`}]} schema={[{'@type':'Service',name:`Blocked drains ${a.name}`,serviceType:'Drain inspection, clearing and repair',provider:{'@id':`${site.url}/#business`},areaServed:{'@type':'Place',name:`${a.name}, NSW`},url:`${site.url}/service-areas/${a.slug}`}]}>
  <section class="wrap page-hero"><div><h1>Blocked Drains<br /><span class="blue">{a.name}</span></h1><p class="lead">A slow drain, repeated blockage or urgent overflow? Get a clear assessment and practical drainage help for your {a.name} property.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button call" href={site.tel}>Call {site.phone}</a><a class="text-link" href="#local-advice">Local booking advice</a></div><p class="fine">Mobile Northern Beaches service · NSW licence {site.licence}</p></div><figure><Photo name={g.image} alt="Drainage work showing equipment or pipework used for inspection and repair" eager /><figcaption class="proof-caption">Drainage technicians and equipment at work.</figcaption></figure></section>
  <div class="wrap content-layout"><article class="reading">
{isNorthBalgowlah && <section class="booking-panel" aria-labelledby="booking-title"><h2 id="booking-title">Arrange Drain Help in North Balgowlah</h2><p>Tell us your address and which fixtures are affected. Mention an active overflow first so the team can discuss the available response.</p><ul><li><strong>Overflowing now:</strong> describe where wastewater is escaping and stop using affected fixtures.</li><li><strong>Blocking again:</strong> tell us when it was last cleared and whether you have camera footage.</li><li><strong>Only after rain:</strong> describe where water collects and any known stormwater access.</li></ul><p>Mention gates, stairs, parking and the person who can approve work. Confirm initial charges, the proposed visit and any reporting requirements when booking.</p><a class="button call" href={site.tel}>Call {site.phone}</a><p class="fine">Attendance and timing are confirmed when you call.</p></section>}
<section id="local-advice"><h2>Drainage Help for {a.name} Properties</h2><p>{a.context}</p><p>{a.booking}</p></section><section><h2>{g.focus}</h2><p>{g.text}</p></section><section><h2>From Symptoms to a Suitable Fix</h2><p>We start with the affected fixtures and the timing of the problem. One slow basin may point to a local waste obstruction; multiple fixtures backing up can point to a restriction farther along the sewer. A rain-only overflow needs the stormwater route considered separately.</p><p>{isNorthBalgowlah ? <><a href="/services/cctv-drain-inspections">CCTV drain inspection</a> helps identify accessible roots, joints and defects.</> : "CCTV helps identify accessible roots, joints and defects."} A heavily obstructed pipe may need clearing before the camera can provide a useful view. The findings guide the next step, rather than the suburb name or the nearest visible tree.</p></section><section><h2>Professional Equipment, Chosen for the Job</h2><p>{isNorthBalgowlah ? <>Suitable <a href="/services/high-pressure-water-jetting">high-pressure water jetting</a> and mechanical clearing tools can remove obstructions.</> : "Suitable water-jetting nozzles and mechanical clearing tools can remove obstructions."} A camera and, where appropriate, locating equipment help investigate recurring faults. We assess pipe material, access and condition before choosing a method.</p><p>When a structural repair is needed, options can include a compatible pipe section and fittings, or a selected liner system where the existing pipe is suitable. Excavation, bedding and surface reinstatement are discussed as part of the scope. Clearing alone cannot rebuild a collapsed pipe or seal an open joint.</p></section>{!isNorthBalgowlah && <section><h2>A Useful First Call from {a.name}</h2><ul><li>Describe what is backing up and whether there is an active overflow.</li><li>Tell us when it began, what triggers it and whether it has happened before.</li><li>Share the access details above, plus any strata or business approval contact.</li><li>Ask about initial charges, the proposed scope and any footage or reporting you need.</li></ul><p>We explain the available response and agree the work before proceeding. An inspection may identify maintenance needs or a separately quoted repair; you will have the findings to discuss your options.</p></section>}
{isNorthBalgowlah && <section><h2>A Closer Look at the Team’s Drainage Work</h2><figure><Photo name="roots" alt="Root mass removed during the plumbing team's drainage work" sizes="(max-width:760px) 90vw, 600px" /><figcaption>Root removal from the wider plumbing service network; the job location is unconfirmed.</figcaption></figure><p>Removing an obstruction creates space in the pipe. Inspection helps assess the entry point and whether further repair is needed. The findings at your property determine the next step.</p><a href="/our-work">See more of the team’s drainage work</a></section>}
</article><aside class="aside"><h2>Help in {a.name}</h2><p>Tell us the address and what you are seeing. Urgent calls are welcome at any hour; timing and access are confirmed during booking.</p><a class="button call" href={site.tel}>{site.phone}</a>{relevant.map(s=><a href={`/services/${s.slug}`}>{s.name}</a>)}<a href="/drain-advice/blocked-drain-costs">Understand the cost factors</a><a href="/our-work">See our team’s work</a></aside></div>
  <section class="section related"><div class="wrap"><h2>Also Serving: {g.name}</h2><div class="related-links">{nearby.map(n=><a href={`/service-areas/${n.slug}`}>{n.name}</a>)}</div></div></section><Cta />
</Layout>

<style>.booking-panel { padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid #2478ac; border-radius: .5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; } .booking-panel h2 { margin-top: 0; }</style>
